<item><title>South African court pushes Kemi Seba extradition hearing to February 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/south-african-court-pushes-kemi-seba-extradition-hearing-to-2a7176/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/south-african-court-pushes-kemi-seba-extradition-hearing-to-2a7176/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The Pretoria hearing on Benin&apos;s request was postponed again, and Seba remains in detention in South Africa.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:43:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" length="29969" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bj.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Benin’s Court of Accounts seeks five times the budget of the High Court of Justice</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-court-of-accounts-seeks-five-times-the-budget-of-2c0ddc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-court-of-accounts-seeks-five-times-the-budget-of-2c0ddc/</guid><category>Benin</category><description>The two courts requested CFA5,88 billion combined, with the Court of Accounts seeking 83,7% of the total for 2027.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:51:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-court-of-accounts-seeks-five-times-the-budget-of-2c0ddc/share.jpg" length="43684" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bj/benin-s-court-of-accounts-seeks-five-times-the-budget-of-2c0ddc/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
